  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be cool if there was an option to see who else is in your friend's world in the social menu. There are a select few people my friends hang out with I would rather avoid and don't want it to be awkward if I join on my friends not knowing the other people are there. Obviously this wouldn't apply to invite and invite+ instances, but public-friends instances are fair game.",
